<title>UK: Premier to drill offshore exploration well.</title>
<headline>Premier to drill offshore exploration well.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Premier Oil Plc said its Premier Oil Exploration Ltd is to drill an offshore exploration well on UK Block 11/24 in the North Sea 20 kilometres south west of Wick in north eastern Scotland.</p>
<p>Drilling will start on September 20 and is expected to go down to 6,500 feet and take around 50 days to complete.</p>
<p>The partners in Block 11/24 are Premier Oil which has 35 percent as operator and Amerada Hess Ltd with 65 percent. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
